@* Wrapper over the AtomBusy* SVG indicators.
   - Name set  -> renders that indicator (case-insensitive; "AtomBusyGears", "BusyGears" or "Gears").
   - Name null -> renders a random indicator (stable across re-renders).
   See AtomBusyIndicator.razor.cs for discovery + parameter forwarding. *@
@inherits AtomComponentBase
@if (ResolvedType is not null)
{
    <DynamicComponent Type="ResolvedType" Parameters="BuildParameters()" />
}
